t public basket in every 40 public condition and compare the whole simulation bytewise. Independently audit all full raw daily ledgers, message masks and applied amounts, targets/physical quotes, resources and all five statistical checks. Two seed subprocesses at most; actual exits and failures are recorded. No full second production tree is claimed.","frozen_at_utc":"2026-10-02T15:21:03.300072+00:00","hypothesis":"Does universally available market information improve joint market dynamics at equal theoretical post-cap received message variance?","interpretation":"With e and z independent variance-one symmetric uniforms, the masked message is R*clip(B*e+A*z,c), R has original Bernoulli probability p. Public delivery is clip(R*B*e+lambda*A*z,c), retaining the identical private receipt hash/mask and keeping unknown private residuals null. Solve lambda in [0,1] from lagged B,A,p,c so p*F(B,lambda*A,c)+(1-p)*F(0,lambda*A,c)=p*F(B,A,c), where F is the exact clipped second moment. Independent and shared market modes have the same one-stock marginal budget; sharing changes cross-stock coupling. Report finite means, finite variances and cap frequencies, which need not coincide with theoretical expectations. Histories stop at t-2, execution references t-1; original common/industry shocks, inventory resources and price feedback remain. This controls only the synthetic company-message component, not total market risk, wealth-weighted risk, real policy news, calibrated investor behavior or causal forecasting. The 123-company 43-day window and previous outcomes are consumed development data. All 80 conditions and all 80 defined paired comparisons are reported. No parameter gains, thresholds, defaults or semantic release are selected after effects; no 2021 validation is claimed.","joint_limits":{"mean_return_gap_max":0.005,"portfolio_volatility_ratio_max":2.0,"portfolio_volatility_ratio_min":0.5,"stock_correlation_gap_max":0.1,"volatility_ratio_max":2.0,"volatility_ratio_min":0.5